        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player third-person shooter that takes you through various levels infested with mutant vegetables each one has unique abilities and attacks, and you'll also have to fight bosses to complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place on a farm, on a road filled with enemies and obstacles, and in a small town at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons include a large cooking spoon that you can use as a melee weapon, a pistol, a machine gun, and bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some places to obtain ammunition, you'll have to destroy large red ants to obtain bullets for the pistol, and much larger black ants for the machine gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a grandmother who is left behind alone and trapped on a farm full of vegetables mutated into giant insects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your granddaughter Sofia leaves you a message that lets you know that in the nearest town there is a helicopter that you can use to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, to get to the town, you must travel along a very bumpy road full of mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures are immune to conventional weapons, but vulnerable to salt and pepper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, your granddaughter Sofia made a saltshaker gun that throws salt cubes and an automatic pepper shaker that throws peppercorns and some special bombs with species.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player third-person shooter that takes you through various levels infested with mutant vegetables each one has unique abilities and attacks, and you'll also have to fight bosses to complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place on a farm, on a road filled with enemies and obstacles, and in a small town at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons include a large cooking spoon that you can use as a melee weapon, a pistol, a machine gun, and bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some places to obtain ammunition, you'll have to destroy large red ants to obtain bullets for the pistol, and much larger black ants for the machine gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a grandmother who is left behind alone and trapped on a farm full of vegetables mutated into giant insects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your granddaughter Sofia leaves you a message that lets you know that in the nearest town there is a helicopter that you can use to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, to get to the town, you must travel along a very bumpy road full of mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures are immune to conventional weapons, but vulnerable to salt and pepper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, your granddaughter Sofia made a saltshaker gun that throws salt cubes and an automatic pepper shaker that throws peppercorns and some special bombs with species.</p>",
        "short_description": "Third-person action shooter, where your mission is to escape. You'll play as a grandma in a world infested by plant-based insects, with only a cooking spoon a salt shaker and a pepper shaker, all adapted as weapons.",
